**Request \[[Create API Key](https://ultracart.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/ucdoc/pages/38688545/API+Simple+Key)\]**
```bash
curl -X POST "https://secure.ultracart.com/rest/v2/customer/customers/email_verify/get_token" \
  -H "Accept: application/json" \
  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \
  -H "X-UltraCart-Api-Version: 2017-03-01" \
  -H "x-ultracart-simple-key: 9e188d66d77f64019a05ae05ac80010039ccbebb1df9b9019a05ae05ac800100" \
  -d $'{
    "email": "test@ultracart.com",
    "password": "squirrel"
}'
```

**Response Headers**
```html
Status: 200 OK
X-UltraCart-Request-Id: 17D1EC7B0ED288019A070BCA7A80011
Content-Type: application/json; charset=UTF-8
Transfer-Encoding: chunked
Date: Tue, 21 Oct 2025 13:53:24 GMT
```

